meaning, an axiom amendment is premature, and gravity remains downstream of a
normalized timed conserved Record current.

Two lenses ranked a modular analytic proof of two explicit returned-tip laws
first because the local factors and discriminator are already concrete and a
four-hour result can dispatch the portfolio sharply.  One lens ranked a
larger autonomous ordinary-`M2` history process first because it combines
invocation, renewal, and selector/source consistency.

The campaign resolves the disagreement by giving the analytic theorem one
strict bounded window.  A complete multiple-law result sends the very next
